    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Email Service (Gmail / Outlook)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn how a billion people send and receive mail without one message getting lost: SMTP in and out, a durable queue, per-user mailbox storage, attachments in a blob store, per-user search, threading and the spam war. You will be able to drive a 45-minute interview on it.</p>\n      "
